title: 'curatedTCGAData: Curated Data from The Cancer Genome Atlas (TCGA) as MultiAssayExperiment
  Objects'
version: 1.35.0
doi: 10.1200/CCI.19.00119
abstract: This package provides publicly available data from The Cancer Genome Atlas
  (TCGA) as MultiAssayExperiment objects. MultiAssayExperiment integrates multiple
  assays (e.g., RNA-seq, copy number, mutation, microRNA, protein, and others) with
  clinical / pathological data. It also links assay barcodes with patient identifiers,
  enabling harmonized subsetting of rows (features) and columns (patients / samples)
  across the entire multi-'omics experiment.
